    "name": "12(vii). Timing of Claims",
    "text": "Timing of Claims Neither party may bring a claim under this Agreement more than two (2) years after the harm that gave rise to the cause of action arose."
  },
  {
    "id": "c061",
    "name": "13(i). Indemnification",
    "text": "INDEMNIFICATION AND INSURANCE The Parties agree to defend, indemnify and hold each other harmless from any and all claims, demands, costs, expenses (including reasonable attorneys’ fees) and liabilities or losses caused or alleged to be caused, by a breach of this Agreement by, or by the acts, errors or omissions of, the indemnifying party, its employees, subcontractors or agents in carrying out the terms of this Agreement. Each party agrees to promptly notify the other upon becoming aware of any claim, suit, yf liability or loss to which this indemnity may apply."
  },
  {
    "id": "c062",
    "name": "13(ii). Insurance",
    "text": "(ii) During the term of this Agreement each party shall maintain policies of insurance which will cover claims or losses which may arise from the party’s performance of services pursuant to this Agreement. Each party’s policy shall name the other party as an additional insured. The insurance coverage to be maintained shall be not less than the following: Statutory Worker’s Compensation; Employer’s Liability - $500,000 per occurrence; Comprehensive General Liability and Product Liability (with broad form Vendors Endorsement naming the other party as an additional insured) in the following amounts: Bodily Injury - $500,000 per person, $1,000,000 per occurrence, Property Damage - $500,000 per occurrence; Personal Injury - $1,000,000 per occurrence; Automobile (including owned, non-owned and hired vehicles) in the following amounts: Bodily Injury - $500,000 per person, $1,000,000 per occurrence, Property Damage - $500,000 per occurrence. In addition to the above coverage, DISTRIBUTOR shall carry excess insurance coverage of $1,000,000 per occurrence covering, at a minimum, General Liability and Automobile Liability. Prior to the effective date of this Agreement, and prior to expiration of any insurance policy for which DISTRIBUTOR is responsible hereunder, DISTRIBUTOR shall provide COMPANY with a Certificate of Insurance evidencing such coverage and naming COMPANY as an additional insured."
  },
  {
