    "text": "7. Notwithstanding anything set forth in any agreement between Ind.Distr. and Premier to the contrary, in the event of any inconsistency or contradiction between the terms and conditions set forth herein as those set forth in any such agreement between Ind.Distr, and Premier, the terms and conditions hereof shall prevail and shall override any inconsistent or contradictory terms and conditions set forth in any agreement between Ind.Distr. and Premier."
